{"game": "alien-swarm", "language": "english", "appid": 630, "month": "2011-06", "window": 3, "start_date": 1308182400, "end_date": 1308787199, "month_true_total": 81, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-06 00:52:40 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "3620092", "author": {"steamid": "76561198025307019", "personaname": "DetectiveFail", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/GamerFail/", "num_games_owned": 575, "num_reviews": 156, "playtime_forever": 465, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 287, "last_played": 1406927048, "avatar": "e51384c0b9d8e2b9fc8edc0a1343051fd053d428"}, "language": "english", "review": "A Nice Decent Game that popped out of the blue! xD\n\nAlien Swarm is basiclly Valve's semi-original New Ip kind of like Portal. The game takes some elements from a top-down Shooter RTS style squad based type of genre, a heavy class-based system, and a great emphasis on teamwork in order to succeed and not FAIL. \n\nSince it's free, the game is an absolute steal at this kind of price which is $0, a game that will keep most of your time running with friends and battling countless hard-core enemies that keep coming back and forth. \nTips:\n\n(Always look forward and back) \n(Try not to hit your enemies from Friendly Fire :P)\n(Choose your class choice wisely as in can change the tide of battle or fail in your favor)\n(Choose the best equipment and material to utilize before each mission)\n(And Finally focus on Teamwork!!!! TEAMWORK!! TEAMWORK!!!!!!!!!!!)\n\n\nOverall Alien Swarm is a nice pretty awesome game in my book that i'd play with my friends and not alone. \n\n8.33/10\n\nGL & HF, \nFail", "timestamp_created": 1308775105, "timestamp_updated": 1308775105, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "ap